"about": {"track":"Cromwell, Nova Zelandija (id cromwell): the circuit on the river terrace south of Cromwell in Central Otago, opened 2013, its long layout (4.100 km, 22 corners), one lap (docs/dirkalisca-celine.md, »Novih pet«): a figure of eight, the west part's lap crossing the east part's on the bridge w677363476 (bridge=yes, layer=1). The route: OSM's highway=raceway ways w234778728, w234778729, w234778731, w234778732 (the chicane before the south loop, not w234778731's straight there) and w677363474 (the bends north of the south-west hairpin, not w234778728's straight there), w677363475-477 (the straight over the bridge), closed, in the driving order; not the short cuts w234778733 (the east loop's), w234778731's nodes 74-75 (the club lap's, past the bridge), w234778729's nodes 0-7 and 34-37, w234778728's nodes 0-6, nor the links w537523924 and w537523943 to the paddock. The direction: as the bridge's ways w677363475-477, w677363474 and w234778729 are drawn in OSM (no source on the direction is reachable from here; OSM has no start line, pit lane nor pit building): south down the east straight, the east part clockwise, the west part anticlockwise. The pit lane and the pit building on the east side of the east straight, the start line by them (tools/cromwell/build.py).","frame":"metres; origin = the start line (lat0, lon0: the first point of the route); x east, z south; x = (lon - lon0) * N cos(lat0), z = -(lat - lat0) * M (WGS84 radii at lat0)","line":"the centre line every 5.001 m from the start line round the lap (closed; the last point joins the first): OSM's polyline every 1 m, a Gaussian of sigma 3 m (the corners rounded), resampled","h":"the road's height at each point of line (m above sea level, 0.1 m): the ground model across the road (median of 5 samples, -8..8 m), the bridges straight from bank to bank, dips under 60 m filled, a 35 m median, sigma 15 m, grades at most 12 %, sigma 5 m","hRaw":"the ground model under each point of line before the smoothing (m, 0.1 m)","ways":"[s0, s1, road name (geographic names only), OSM highway, lanes, width, oneway today, surface, maxspeed, bridge]: the route's OSM ways in driving order (s in m from the start line)","bends":"[s of the apex, radius m, side (1 right, -1 left), turn deg]: the bends of line with a radius under 60 m","bld":"[x, z, length, width, angle (rad, the long side from +x towards +z), height (m, 0 = not in OSM), kind, s, d (m, + right of the travel direction)]: the buildings with any part within 900 m (OSM); kinds: 0 house / unknown, 1 church / chapel, 2 tower, 3 castle, 4 shed / garage / kiosk, 5 commercial / hotel / industrial, 6 public / station / school, 7 greenhouse, 8 ruin, 9 block of flats","bldOutline":"[index in bld, [x, z, ...]]: the outline of the buildings that are not a rectangle","trees":"[x, z, kind]: single trees (OSM) within 100 m; kind p pine, c cypress, o olive, m palm, b broadleaved, '' unknown","treeRows":"[kind, [x, z, ...]]","walls":"[barrier (OSM: wall, retaining_wall, fence, guard_rail, hedge ...), height (0 = untagged), wall / material, [x, z, ...]]: within 60 m","coast":"[x, z, ...]: the coastline within 400 m (OSM: the land on the left of the way's direction, the sea on the right)","cliffs":"[x, z, ...]: cliffs within 300 m (OSM: the lower side on the right)","lakes":"[water (OSM water=: lake, river, pond ...), name (geographic), closed (0: a ring cut off where the data ends), [x, z, ...]]: lakes and rivers as areas within 100 m","shore":"[natural (beach, bare_rock ...), [x, z, ...] outline]: within 300 m","water":"[waterway, name (geographic), culvert / tunnel, [x, z, ...]]: streams within 100 m","rail":"[railway (rail, funicular ...), bridge, tunnel, [x, z, ...]]: within 200 m","roads":"[highway, lanes, width, 1 bridge / 2 tunnel, layer, surface, name (geographic), par (1: a carriageway alongside the route), [x, z, ...]]: other roads and paths within 150 m (clipped to 170 m)","side":"[s, side (1 right, -1 left), angle (deg from